<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Premium — LinguaLearn</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --white: #ffffff; --off-white: #f7f9fc; --ink: #0d1526; --muted: #7a87a0;
            --border: #e2e8f2; --blue: #2563eb; --blue-bg: #eff6ff;
            --gold: #ca8a04; --gold-light: #fbbf24; --gold-bg: #fefce8;
            --green: #16a34a; --green-bg: #f0fdf4; --radius: 12px; --radius-lg: 20px;
        }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; background: var(--off-white);
            color: var(--ink); min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .success-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
            max-width: 520px; width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Gold top accent */
        .success-card::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-light), var(--gold));
        }

        /* Confetti dots background */
        .success-card::after {
            content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background-image:
                radial-gradient(circle, rgba(202,138,4,.08) 1px, transparent 1px),
                radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37,99,235,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 32px 32px, 48px 48px;
            background-position: 0 0, 16px 16px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .success-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

        .success-icon {
            width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-bg), #fff9e6);
            border: 2px solid rgba(202,138,4,.2);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2.25rem; margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
            animation: bounceIn .6s cubic-bezier(.68,-.55,.265,1.55) both;
        }

        @keyframes bounceIn {
            from { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; }
            to   { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .success-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: .65rem;
            letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: .75rem;
        }

        .success-title {
            font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: .75rem; line-height: 1.25;
        }
        .success-title em { color: var(--gold); font-style: italic; }

        .success-desc {
            font-size: .87rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .plan-pill {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem;
            background: var(--gold-bg); border: 1.5px solid rgba(202,138,4,.2);
            color: var(--gold); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em;
            text-transform: uppercase; padding: .4rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .success-actions {
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem;
            padding: .85rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: var(--blue); color: var(--white); border: none;
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
            transition: background .2s, transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,.25);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #1d4ed8; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37,99,235,.35); }

        .btn-secondary {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem;
            padding: .8rem 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
            background: transparent; color: var(--muted);
            border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
            transition: border-color .2s, color .2s, background .2s;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue-bg); }

        .success-note {
            margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: .74rem; color: var(--muted);
            font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="success-card">
        <div class="success-inner">

            <div class="success-icon">👑</div>

            <div class="success-eyebrow">Payment Successful</div>

            <h1 class="success-title">You're now<br><em>Premium</em></h1>

            <p class="success-desc">
                Your subscription is active and all premium content is now unlocked.
                Time to accelerate your language learning journey.
            </p>

            <div class="plan-pill">
                ✦ {{ plan == 'YEARLY' ? 'Yearly' : 'Monthly' }} Plan Active
            </div>

            <div class="success-actions">
                <a href="{{ path('user_dashboard') }}" class="btn-primary">
                    Go to Dashboard →
                </a>
                <a href="{{ path('language_select') }}" class="btn-secondary">
                    🌍 Start Learning
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="success-note">
                A confirmation email will be sent to your inbox shortly.<br>
                Manage your subscription anytime from
                <a href="{{ path('pricing') }}" style="color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;">Plans & Billing</a>.
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
